WEBVTT

00:08:59.196 --> 00:09:00.356
That's not it.

00:09:00.396 --> 00:09:04.396
Addressing climate change
means building a new world.

00:09:04.396 --> 00:09:06.836
A world in which energy is healthier,

00:09:06.876 --> 00:09:08.836
doesn't pollute the air we breathe

00:09:08.876 --> 00:09:12.636
and where it's cheaper and everyone
globally has access to it.

00:09:13.236 --> 00:09:15.316
A world with higher incomes,

00:09:15.316 --> 00:09:17.356
longer and better lives,

00:09:17.396 --> 00:09:19.116
greater equality.

00:09:19.836 --> 00:09:21.516
A better world.

00:09:22.316 --> 00:09:24.076
Thank you, and let's make it happen.

00:09:24.076 --> 00:09:28.676
(Applause)